#: ../../source/docs/flight-modes.rst:5 4e82147efe0e4c3a86141e057e96cbf6
msgid "Calibration: Flight Modes"
msgstr "校准：飞行模式"

#: ../../source/docs/flight-modes.rst:7 302cbe102c064f2595902464f4b7e339
msgid ""
"This article shows how to use APM Planner to select flight modes and save"
" them to your transmitter's switch positions. For other calibration tasks"
" see :ref:`Autopilot calibration <autopilot-calibration>`."
msgstr ""
"本文介绍如何使用 APM Planner 选择飞行模式并将其保存到遥控器的开关位置。有关其他校准任务，请参阅 :ref:`飞控校准 "
"<autopilot-calibration>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/flight-modes.rst:12 890a78aabe344328859faadedf9924ed
msgid "1 Prerequisites"
msgstr "1 前提条件"

#: ../../source/docs/flight-modes.rst:14 4723f3324fce48c5ab01e0d565a2f936
#, fuzzy
msgid "Before performing setup, ensure that:"
msgstr "在执行设置之前，请确保："

#: ../../source/docs/flight-modes.rst:16 9aa348553316489e95cf5c1299aeaa17
msgid "The vehicle is completely built to flight condition."
msgstr "飞行器已完整组装至可飞行状态。"

#: ../../source/docs/flight-modes.rst:17 b080efd3ee0b45bbae4caa2cb7326e3e
msgid ":ref:`Firmware has been loaded onto the autopilot. <install-firmware>`"
msgstr ":ref:`固件已加载到飞控中。 <install-firmware>`"

#: ../../source/docs/flight-modes.rst:18 9669241355cc4c28a58f2e96950dc7e4
msgid ""
":ref:`Autopilot is connected to APM Planner and connected to MavLink. "
"<connect-autopilot>`"
msgstr ":ref:`飞控已连接至 APM Planner 并连接至 MAVLink。 <connect-autopilot>`"

#: ../../source/docs/flight-modes.rst:19 4d1d588086e14bea888160361ec72399
msgid ":ref:`Radio calibration is complete. <radio-calibration>`"
msgstr ":ref:`遥控器校准已完成。 <radio-calibration>`"

#: ../../source/docs/flight-modes.rst:22 f47dfa85fcc84eabb40f06bd8e9e3768
msgid "2 Assign Flight Modes"
msgstr "2 分配飞行模式"

#: ../../source/docs/flight-modes.rst:24 a463cee0c61d421d9a41251f1e45ba3c
msgid ""
"Under Mandatory Hardware, select Flight Modes. Turn on your transmitter "
"and move the switches to their available positions to see which flight "
"mode will apply to each position. The currently selected position is "
"shown highlighted in green. Select a flight mode for each available "
"switch position. Some sample modes for copters are shown below."
msgstr ""
"在「Mandatory Hardware」（必要硬件）下，选择「Flight "
"Modes」（飞行模式）。打开遥控器并拨动开关至各可用位置，查看每个位置对应的飞行模式。当前所选位置以绿色高亮显示。为每个可用的开关位置选择一个飞行模式。以下是多旋翼的一些示例模式。"

#: ../../source/docs/flight-modes.rst:33 5dc13ebb8bbb4965929b7ca51004af05
msgid "Select Save to save the flight modes to the autopilot."
msgstr "选择「Save」将飞行模式保存至飞控。"

#: ../../source/docs/flight-modes.rst:35 da2ecd8873c64e3489868ea6fb04f33e
msgid ""
"Click here to learn about available :ref:`flight modes for copter <copter"
":flight-modes>` and :ref:`flight modes for planes <plane:flight-modes>`."
msgstr ""
"点击此处了解 :ref:`多旋翼可用飞行模式 <copter:flight-modes>` 和 :ref:`固定翼可用飞行模式 <plane"
":flight-modes>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/flight-modes.rst:38 7f8fcc99eac24e91841e88437f0af8c2
msgid "3 Simple Mode (copter only)"
msgstr "3 Simple 模式（仅限多旋翼）"

#: ../../source/docs/flight-modes.rst:40 7f39ee58fa734cd4b3b8492cf83781a7
msgid ""
"To apply simple mode to any of your selected flight modes, check the "
"simple mode box next to that mode. For more information about simple "
"mode, :ref:`visit the wiki page here <copter:simpleandsuper-simple-"
"modes>`."
msgstr ""
"若要将 Simple 模式应用于任何已选飞行模式，请勾选该模式旁边的 Simple 模式复选框。有关 Simple 模式的更多信息，请 "
":ref:`访问此 Wiki 页面 <copter:simpleandsuper-simple-modes>`。"

